{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"へい！\nへいへいへーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ビッグサイトにて個別握手会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日のあみは真っ白コーデだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ白〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなになんで今日のあみはそんなに真っ白なの〜？ってたくさん聞かれたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昨日雪だったからね〜(^^)」って答えた。ははは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとこの日はひなちまの生誕祭がありました！誕生日当日だったんだよね！\nおめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと17歳だって、誰が信じるよ、この色気と落ち着きで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと昨日の乃木どこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョンソンもスキーロケに参加させていただきました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭長い(´･Д･)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さんにあみの選んだスキーウェアがふなっしーみたいだとツッコまれました。笑\n言われてみれば...確かに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にしのうじょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい食われる！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキーはこのロケをきっかけにめちゃ好きになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初はかなり苦戦しましたが、\nこれがなかなか上達しちゃうんだな〜❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケバトルもなぜかトップバッターで突然まあやと1対1で対決だと言われ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"十八番とまではいかないけど\n昭和の曲しか歌えない能條は 美空ひばりさんの「お祭りマンボ」を歌いました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ昭和の曲好きなんです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも松田聖子さん、工藤静香さん、山口百恵さんなどもよく歌います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次週もお楽しみに〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！\nそういえば、27日発売のCool-Up Girls観ていただけたました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條が表紙にいます。これはも〜、珍しい珍しい！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌のお仕事もね〜、これからもっとやってみたいものです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、最後に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/02/1268260/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょーがずーに壁ドン。"}],"source":"archive"}